72,888,892,903,968,1103,1109,1131,1135,1151,1157],[224,225,226],"p",{},"An application is the deployable unit in Kinotic. Projects are the building blocks that make up an application. This page explains how to configure both.",[228,229,231],"h2",{"id":230},"applications","Applications",[224,233,234],{},"Every application has:",[236,237,238,251,266],"ul",{},[239,240,241,245,246,250],"li",{},[242,243,244],"strong",{},"Name"," -- A human-readable name (e.g., ",[247,248,249],"code",{},"Inventory App",").",[239,252,253,256,257,260,261,265],{},[242,254,255],{},"Id"," -- Derived from the name at creation: the slugified name, made of lowercase letters, digits, and interior dashes (e.g., ",[247,258,259],{},"inventory-app","). The id forms the final label of the application's ",[262,263,264],"a",{"href":206},"zone",".",[239,267,268,271],{},[242,269,270],{},"Description"," -- A human-readable summary of what the application does.",[224,273,274],{},"Applications are created and managed through the Kinotic CLI and the Kinotic OS dashboard.",[228,276,278],{"id":277},"projects","Projects",[224,280,281,282,285,286,289],{},"A project is a directory with its own ",[247,283,284],{},"package.json"," and a ",[247,287,288],{},".config\u002Fkinotic.config.ts"," configuration file. The CLI uses that config to understand how the project fits into the broader application.",[291,292,294,295,297],"h3",{"id":293},"the-configkinoticconfigts-file","The ",[247,296,288],{}," File",[224,299,300,301,303,304,307],{},"Every project carries a ",[247,302,288],{},", created when Kinotic OS provisions\nthe project repository. It is a TypeScript module exporting a ",[247,305,306],{},"KinoticProjectConfig",", so\nyour editor type-checks it:",[309,310,315],"pre",{"className":311,"code":312,"language":313,"meta":314,"style":314},"language-ts shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","import type { KinoticProjectConfig } from '@kinotic-ai\u002Fmanagement-api'\n\nconst config: KinoticProjectConfig = {\n  organizationId: \"my-org\",\n  applicationId: \"my-app\",\n  projectId: \"my-app-main\",\n  entitiesPaths: [\n    {\n      path: \"packages\u002Fdomain\u002Fmodel\",\n      repositoryPath: \"packages\u002Fdomain\u002Frepositories\",\n      mirrorFolderStructure: true\n    }\n  ],\n  fileExtensionForImports: \".js\",\n  validate: false\n}\n\nexport default config\n","ts","",[247,316,317,353,360,382,403,420,437,448,454,471,488,500,506,514,531,542,548,553],{"__ignoreMap":314},[318,319,322,326,329,333,337,340,343,346,350],"span",{"class":320,"line":321},"line",1,[318,323,325],{"class":324},"s7zQu","import",[318,327,328],{"class":324}," type",[318,330,332],{"class":331},"sMK4o"," {",[318,334,336],{"class":335},"sTEyZ"," KinoticProjectConfig",[318,338,339],{"class":331}," }",[318,341,342],{"class":324}," from",[318,344,345],{"class":331}," '",[318,347,349],{"class":348},"sfazB","@kinotic-ai\u002Fmanagement-api",[318,351,352],{"class":331},"'\n",[318,354,356],{"class":320,"line":355},2,[318,357,359],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":358},true,"\n",[318,361,363,367,370,373,376,379],{"class":320,"line":362},3,[318,364,366],{"class":365},"spNyl","const",[318,368,369],{"class":335}," config",[318,371,372],{"class":331},":",[318,374,336],{"class":375},"sBMFI",[318,377,378],{"class":331}," =",[318,380,381],{"class":331}," {\n",[318,383,385,389,391,394,397,400],{"class":320,"line":384},4,[318,386,388],{"class":387},"swJcz","  organizationId",[318,390,372],{"class":331},[318,392,393],{"class":331}," \"",[318,395,396],{"class":348},"my-org",[318,398,399],{"class":331},"\"",[318,401,402],{"class":331},",\n",[318,404,406,409,411,413,416,418],{"class":320,"line":405},5,[318,407,408],{"class":387},"  applicationId",[318,410,372],{"class":331},[318,412,393],{"class":331},[318,414,415],{"class":348},"my-app",[318,417,399],{"class":331},[318,419,402],{"class":331},[318,421,423,426,428,430,433,435],{"class":320,"line":422},6,[318,424,425],{"class":387},"  projectId",[318,427,372],{"class":331},[318,429,393],{"class":331},[318,431,432],{"class":348},"my-app-main",[318,434,399],{"class":331},[318,436,402],{"class":331},[318,438,440,443,445],{"class":320,"line":439},7,[318,441,442],{"class":387},"  entitiesPaths",[318,444,372],{"class":331},[318,446,447],{"class":335}," [\n",[318,449,451],{"class":320,"line":450},8,[318,452,453],{"class":331},"    {\n",[318,455,457,460,462,464,467,469],{"class":320,"line":456},9,[318,458,459],{"class":387},"      path",[318,461,372],{"class":331},[318,463,393],{"class":331},[318,465,466],{"class":348},"packages\u002Fdomain\u002Fmodel",[318,468,399],{"class":331},[318,470,402],{"class":331},[318,472,474,477,479,481,484,486],{"class":320,"line":473},10,[318,475,476],{"class":387},"      repositoryPath",[318,478,372],{"class":331},[318,480,393],{"class":331},[318,482,483],{"class":348},"packages\u002Fdomain\u002Frepositories",[318,485,399],{"class":331},[318,487,402],{"class":331},[318,489,491,494,496],{"class":320,"line":490},11,[318,492,493],{"class":387},"      mirrorFolderStructure",[318,495,372],{"class":331},[318,497,499],{"class":498},"sfNiH"," true\n",[318,501,503],{"class":320,"line":502},12,[318,504,505],{"class":331},"    }\n",[318,507,509,512],{"class":320,"line":508},13,[318,510,511],{"class":335},"  ]",[318,513,402],{"class":331},[318,515,517,520,522,524,527,529],{"class":320,"line":516},14,[318,518,519],{"class":387},"  fileExtensionForImports",[318,521,372],{"class":331},[318,523,393],{"class":331},[318,525,526],{"class":348},".js",[318,528,399],{"class":331},[318,530,402],{"class":331},[318,532,534,537,539],{"class":320,"line":533},15,[318,535,536],{"class":387},"  validate",[318,538,372],{"class":331},[318,540,541],{"class":498}," false\n",[318,543,545],{"class":320,"line":544},16,[318,546,547],{"class":331},"}\n",[318,549,551],{"class":320,"line":550},17,[318,552,359],{"emptyLinePlaceholder":358},[318,554,556,559,562],{"class":320,"line":555},18,[318,557,558],{"class":324},"export",[318,560,561],{"class":324}," default",[318,563,564],{"class":335}," config\n",[224,566,567,568,571,572,575,576,578,579,582],{},"The CLI reads the first ",[247,569,570],{},"kinotic.config.*"," file it finds in ",[247,573,574],{},".config",", so a ",[247,577,526],{}," or ",[247,580,581],{},".json"," config\nis loaded the same way.",[584,585,587],"h4",{"id":586},"fields","Fields",[589,590,591,603],"table",{},[592,593,594],"thead",{},[595,596,597,601],"tr",{},[598,599,600],"th",{},"Field",[598,602,270],{},[604,605,606,620,632,648,664,678,712,727,739],"tbody",{},[595,607,608,614],{},[609,610,611],"td",{},[247,612,613],{},"organizationId",[609,615,616,619],{},[242,617,618],{},"Required."," The id of the Kinotic organization this project belongs to.",[595,621,622,627],{},[609,623,624],{},[247,625,626],{},"applicationId",[609,628,629,631],{},[242,630,618],{}," The application id this project belongs to. Must match the application id registered with Kinotic OS: lowercase letters, digits, and interior dashes.",[595,633,634,639],{},[609,635,636],{},[247,637,638],{},"projectId",[609,640,641,643,644,647],{},[242,642,618],{}," The id of this project in Kinotic OS. Provisioned repositories carry the id of the project that created them; ",[247,645,646],{},"kinotic sync"," addresses this project and fails when it does not exist.",[595,649,650,655],{},[609,651,652],{},[247,653,654],{},"name",[609,656,657,658,660,661,663],{},"Optional project name. When omitted, the ",[247,659,654],{}," from the project's ",[247,662,284],{}," is used.",[595,665,666,671],{},[609,667,668],{},[247,669,670],{},"description",[609,672,673,674,660,676,663],{},"Optional project description. When omitted, the ",[247,675,670],{},[247,677,284],{},[595,679,680,685],{},[609,681,682],{},[247,683,684],{},"entitiesPaths",[609,686,687,689,690,693,694,697,698,701,702,705,706,709,710,265],{},[242,688,618],{}," An array whose entries are either a plain path string or an ",[247,691,692],{},"EntitiesPathConfig"," object with ",[247,695,696],{},"path"," (the directory containing entity definitions), ",[247,699,700],{},"repositoryPath"," (where the CLI writes generated repository classes), and ",[247,703,704],{},"mirrorFolderStructure"," (whether to replicate the entity directory structure in the output, default ",[247,707,708],{},"true","). The CLI scans these paths when you run ",[247,711,646],{},[595,713,714,719],{},[609,715,716],{},[247,717,718],{},"generatedPath",[609,720,721,722,724,725,265],{},"The default output path for generated files, used for ",[247,723,684],{}," entries that are plain strings. Ignored for entries that use ",[247,726,692],{},[595,728,729,734],{},[609,730,731],{},[247,732,733],{},"fileExtensionForImports",[609,735,736,737,265],{},"The extension the CLI writes on import paths in generated code. Defaults to ",[247,738,526],{},[595,740,741,746],{},[609,742,743],{},[247,744,745],{},"validate",[609,747,748],{},"When true, generated repository classes validate data before sending it to the server.",[291,750,752],{"id":751},"project-dependencies","Project Dependencies",[224,754,755,756,758],{},"Projects within the same application can depend on each other. For example, a microservice project might import entity types defined in a persistence project. These dependencies are managed through standard ",[247,757,284],{}," -- you add the dependency just like any other Bun package.",[309,760,764],{"className":761,"code":762,"language":763,"meta":314,"style":314},"language-json shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","{\n    \"dependencies\": {\n        \"@my-org\u002Fdata\": \"workspace:*\"\n    }\n}\n","json",[247,765,766,771,785,805,809],{"__ignoreMap":314},[318,767,768],{"class":320,"line":321},[318,769,770],{"class":331},"{\n",[318,772,773,776,779,781,783],{"class":320,"line":355},[318,774,775],{"class":331},"    \"",[318,777,778],{"class":365},"dependencies",[318,780,399],{"class":331},[318,782,372],{"class":331},[318,784,381],{"class":331},[318,786,787,790,793,795,797,799,802],{"class":320,"line":362},[318,788,789],{"class":331},"        \"",[318,791,792],{"class":375},"@my-org\u002Fdata",[318,794,399],{"class":331},[318,796,372],{"class":331},[318,798,393],{"class":331},[318,800,801],{"class":348},"workspace:*",[318,803,804],{"class":331},"\"\n",[318,806,807],{"class":320,"line":384},[318,808,505],{"class":331},[318,810,811],{"class":320,"line":405},[318,812,547],{"class":331},[224,814,815],{},"When the application is deployed, the platform resolves these internal dependencies and ensures all projects are available to each other through the Service Directory.",[228,817,819],{"id":818},"deployable-packages","Deployable packages",[224,821,822,823,825],{},"When a push deploys a project (see ",[262,824,119],{"href":120},"), the\nplatform finds the packages it deploys by where they sit in the workspace:",[236,827,828,849],{},[239,829,830,833,834,837,838,840,841,844,845,848],{},[242,831,832],{},"Microservices"," live directly under ",[247,835,836],{},"packages\u002Fmicroservices",", one package each. A\nmicroservice runs in a VM of its own from its ",[247,839,284],{}," ",[247,842,843],{},"main",", or ",[247,846,847],{},"src\u002Fmain.ts"," when\nit declares none.",[239,850,851,833,854,857,858,861,862,865,866,868,869,871],{},[242,852,853],{},"UIs",[247,855,856],{},"packages\u002Fui",", one package each, and declare a ",[247,859,860],{},"build"," script\nthat writes ",[247,863,864],{},"dist\u002Findex.html",". A package under ",[247,867,856],{}," without a ",[247,870,860],{}," script is a\nlibrary and is left alone.",[224,873,874,875,840,877,879,880,883,884,887],{},"A package's identity is the unscoped part of its ",[247,876,284],{},[247,878,654],{}," (",[247,881,882],{},"@acme\u002Fadmin"," is\n",[247,885,886],{},"admin","), which must be lowercase letters, digits, and interior dashes and unique among the\npackages of its kind. The directory name never matters.",[291,889,891],{"id":890},"the-ui-build-contract","The UI build contract",[224,893,894,895,898,899,902],{},"Every UI is built during the deployment with ",[247,896,897],{},"bun run build",", and the build is handed the\nplatform's address as three variables. Vite exposes ",[247,900,901],{},"VITE_*"," variables to the page on its\nown, so a Vite project reads them with no configuration; a UI with another build tool must\npass them through itself:",[589,904,905,918],{},[592,906,907],{},[595,908,909,912,915],{},[598,910,911],{},"Variable",[598,913,914],{},"Value",[598,916,917],{},"What the UI does with it",[604,919,920,936,951],{},[595,921,922,927,933],{},[609,923,924],{},[247,925,926],{},"VITE_KINOTIC_HOST",[609,928,929,930],{},"e.g. ",[247,931,932],{},"api.kinotic.ai",[609,934,935],{},"The host the UI connects to Kinotic on from a browser",[595,937,938,943,948],{},[609,939,940],{},[247,941,942],{},"VITE_KINOTIC_PORT",[609,944,929,945],{},[247,946,947],{},"443",[609,949,950],{},"Its port",[595,952,953,958,965],{},[609,954,955],{},[247,956,957],{},"VITE_KINOTIC_USE_SSL",[609,959,960,578,962],{},[247,961,708],{},[247,963,964],{},"false",[609,966,967],{},"Whether to connect over TLS",[309,969,971],{"className":311,"code":970,"language":313,"meta":314,"style":314},"await Kinotic.connect({\n    server: {\n        host: import.meta.env.VITE_KINOTIC_HOST,\n        port: parseInt(import.meta.env.VITE_KINOTIC_PORT),\n        useSSL: import.meta.env.VITE_KINOTIC_USE_SSL === 'true',\n    },\n})\n",[247,972,973,992,1001,1027,1056,1090,1095],{"__ignoreMap":314},[318,974,975,978,981,983,987,990],{"class":320,"line":321},[318,976,977],{"class":324},"await",[318,979,980],{"class":335}," Kinotic",[318,982,265],{"class":331},[318,984,986],{"class":985},"s2Zo4","connect",[318,988,989],{"class":335},"(",[318,991,770],{"class":331},[318,993,994,997,999],{"class":320,"line":355},[318,995,996],{"class":387},"    server",[318,998,372],{"class":331},[318,1000,381],{"class":331},[318,1002,1003,1006,1008,1011,1013,1016,1018,1021,1023,1025],{"class":320,"line":362},[318,1004,1005],{"class":387},"        host",[318,1007,372],{"class":331},[318,1009,1010],{"class":324}," import",[318,1012,265],{"class":331},[318,1014,1015],{"class":335},"meta",[318,1017,265],{"class":331},[318,1019,1020],{"class":335},"env",[318,1022,265],{"class":331},[318,1024,926],{"class":335},[318,1026,402],{"class":331},[318,1028,1029,1032,1034,1037,1039,1041,1043,1045,1047,1049,1051,1054],{"class":320,"line":384},[318,1030,1031],{"class":387},"        port",[318,1033,372],{"class":331},[318,1035,1036],{"class":985}," parseInt",[318,1038,989],{"class":335},[318,1040,325],{"class":324},[318,1042,265],{"class":331},[318,1044,1015],{"class":335},[318,1046,265],{"class":331},[318,1048,1020],{"class":335},[318,1050,265],{"class":331},[318,1052,1053],{"class":335},"VITE_KINOTIC_PORT)",[318,1055,402],{"class":331},[318,1057,1058,1061,1063,1065,1067,1069,1071,1073,1075,1078,1081,1083,1085,1088],{"class":320,"line":405},[318,1059,1060],{"class":387},"        useSSL",[318,1062,372],{"class":331},[318,1064,1010],{"class":324},[318,1066,265],{"class":331},[318,1068,1015],{"class":335},[318,1070,265],{"class":331},[318,1072,1020],{"class":335},[318,1074,265],{"class":331},[318,1076,1077],{"class":335},"VITE_KINOTIC_USE_SSL ",[318,1079,1080],{"class":331},"===",[318,1082,345],{"class":331},[318,1084,708],{"class":348},[318,1086,1087],{"class":331},"'",[318,1089,402],{"class":331},[318,1091,1092],{"class":320,"line":422},[318,1093,1094],{"class":331},"    },\n",[318,1096,1097,1100],{"class":320,"line":439},[318,1098,1099],{"class":331},"}",[318,1101,1102],{"class":335},")\n",[224,1104,1105,1106,1108],{},"A build that does not write ",[247,1107,864],{}," fails the deployment naming the UI.",[224,1110,1111,1114,1115,1118,1119,1122,1123,1126,1127,1130],{},[247,1112,1113],{},"dist"," is published as it is, from the site's root: files under ",[247,1116,1117],{},"assets\u002F"," carry a content\nhash in their name and are cached for a year, everything else is never cached. Each site\nalso publishes the commit it serves as ",[247,1120,1121],{},"version.json"," next to its ",[247,1124,1125],{},"index.html",", never\ncached, as ",[247,1128,1129],{},"{ \"commitSha\": \"\u003Ccommit>\" }",". A publish replaces the previous commit's files;\na tab left open on the previous commit loads the new commit when it next reloads.",[228,1132,1134],{"id":1133},"typical-setup","Typical Setup",[224,1136,1137,1138,1141,1142,1144,1145,1147,1148,1150],{},"Most applications start with a single project created through Kinotic OS, which provisions a GitHub repository scaffolded as a Bun workspace mono repo: ",[247,1139,1140],{},"packages\u002Fdomain"," (entity model and generated repositories), ",[247,1143,836],{},", ",[247,1146,856],{},", and a ",[247,1149,288],{}," wired to the owning organization and application. Clone the provisioned repository and start building.",[224,1152,1153,1154,1156],{},"As the application grows, you can add additional projects for microservices, batch jobs, or frontends -- each with its own ",[247,1155,288],{}," pointing to the same application identifier.",[1158,1159,1160],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shi